### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@alertId = 1

### Get all alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts

### Filter active high-severity alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=ACTIVE&severity=HIGH

### Filter by hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?organizationId=1&labId=1&roomId=1&sensorId=1

### Get one alert
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}

### Acknowledge alert
# Requires an authenticated session and CSRF token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge

### Resolve alert
# Requires an authenticated session and CSRF token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve
